@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080

### Health check
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### Get invoice
GET {{baseUrl}}/invoices/3

### Create invoice
POST {{baseUrl}}/invoices
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "invoice_number": "INV-{{$timestamp}}",
  "unit_id": 1,
  "due_date": "2026-09-30T00:00:00Z",
  "items": [
    {
      "description": "Monthly service fee",
      "amount_cents": 150000
    }
  ]
}
